{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-golf-vista-heights","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"golf-vista-heights","about":"Experience the pinnacle of luxury living at Golf Vista Heights, a prestigious development by London Gate, situated in the vibrant heart of Dubai Sports City. Each morning, awaken to the mesmerizing views of a pristine golf course, a view that sets a tranquil tone for your day. Golf Vista Heights by London Gate offers not just homes, but private terraces that overlook the sweeping vistas of lush greenery, creating a sanctuary of peace and elegance. This is more than a residence—it's a lifestyle choice where every second is valued, and every scenery is a breathtaking masterpiece.Golf Vista Heights stands as a beacon of tranquility within the bustling Dubai Sports City, offering a harmonious blend of calm and luxury. This family-centric community is your gateway to the captivating views of the golf course, providing a sumptuous retreat that transcends the norms of everyday living.With a grand total of 209 units spread over B+G+14 floors, Golf Vista Heights floorplans showcases modern architecture at its finest. This collection includes 73 studio apartments, 91 one-bedroom units with options for open or closed kitchens, 43 two-bedroom apartments tailored with various kitchen designs, and 2 three-bedroom units featuring exclusive kitchens. Each home in Golf Vista Heights is a masterpiece of design, boasting floor-to-ceiling windows that frame the magnificent views, alongside creatively crafted built-in wardrobes and elegant ensuite bathrooms. Dive into the luxurious lifestyle offered at Golf Vista Heights for sale, now available in Dubai Sports City, and elevate your living experience.","price":450000,"title":"Golf Vista Heights","bitrix":{"id":369,"pf_id":"are.2.13426","source":null,"project_id":"Golf Vista Heights","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Golf Vista he